I walk slowly through the museum.
Outside, the rain falls strongly on the roof.
But this hall is very peaceful.
There are a lot of old things here.
I see a large glass box.
What is that?
I go near that box.
Inside it, there are some old coins and pieces of wood.
I read the small board next to it.
It is about an old Portuguese ship.
That ship came to Kochi hundreds of years ago.
But it sank in the sea.
These are parts of that ship.
Kochi has a very deep history.
A very long time ago, people from many countries came here.
I think about my journey too.
To me, that feels like a long time ago.
But in front of this history, it is nothing.
I spend a peaceful hour in that museum.
